{68}{That's why I come here!}{}{-4}{qa1054 1}{83}{}
{69}{Uh...whut happen?}{}{-4}{qu1054 0}{74}{}
{72}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{74}{Well, back then the Williamsons wasn't exactly rich, but we was well off...owned land and had a nice house.  But one day old Stringy Pete the pirate came a' wanderin' into town and killed my grandfather Jonas dead, right in the middle of the street.  Legend says that old Pete was laughin' whilst he did it, even when he stole the silver buckles off my great-grandaddy's boots!}{Well, back then the Williamsons wasn't exactly rich, but we was well off...owned land and had a nice house.  But one day old Stringy Pete the pirate came a' wanderin' into town and killed my grandfather Jonas dead, right in the middle of the street.  Legend says that old Pete was laughin' whilst he did it, even when he stole the silver buckles off my great-grandaddy's boots!}{}{}{}{}
{75}{I see.  Quite a tragic tale...}{}{5}{}{78}{}
{76}{That very sad...}{}{-4}{}{78}{}
{78}{Yeah...its definitely not a bedtime story, mister.  The Williamsons...we fell on hard times after that.  Without a man to work the place, we lost our land and our house.  My family been livin' out here in this shanty for the last 100 years.  Ain't a day goes by that I don't curse the name 'a that bloody Stringy Pete!  [She spits on the ground.]}{Yeah...its definitely not a bedtime story, miss.  The Williamsons...we fell on hard times after that.  Without a man to work the place, we lost our land and our house.  My family been livin' out here in this shanty for the last 100 years.  Ain't a day goes by that I don't curse the name 'a that bloody Stringy Pete!  [She spits on the ground.]}{}{}{}{}
